passwordResets.emailBody:
Hi {name},

You asked to reset the password of your Palee account @{handle}. Open this link to choose a new one:

{link}

The link works once and is valid for 24 hours. When you set your new password, you will be signed out on every device.

If you didn't ask for this, just ignore this email. Your password stays as it is.

{sender}
